<!-- Shopify theme sync: Intelligence section dependency; keep before page.intelligence.json activation. -->
<section class="tk-ip">
  <div class="tk-shell">
    <div class="tk-ip-hero">
      <div class="tk-ip-hero-copy">
        <span class="tk-ip-kicker">TRACEKIT INTELLIGENCE · BUILT IN</span>
        <h1>Stop searching for answers.<br><em>Start understanding.</em></h1>
        <p>Meet the intelligence layer built into TraceKit. Explore performance, investigate discrepancies, and follow the source evidence behind your business numbers—without stitching together disconnected dashboards.</p>
        <div class="tk-ip-actions"><a class="btn" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Explore Intelligence in a Demo →</a><span>Built in. MCP is optional.</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="tk-ip-hero-visual" aria-label="Illustrative TraceKit Intelligence investigation">
        <div class="tk-ip-window-head"><div class="tk-ip-product"><img src="{{ 'tracekit-symbol-white-k.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><div><strong>TraceKit Intelligence</strong><small>Evidence-backed investigation</small></div></div><span class="tk-ip-status">Illustrative</span></div>
        <div class="tk-ip-prompt"><span>QUESTION</span><strong>Which affiliates are linked to these chargebacks?</strong></div>
        <div class="tk-ip-result"><span>EXAMPLE FINDING</span><div class="tk-ip-result-total"><strong>12 chargebacks</strong><small>$1,846 disputed</small></div><div class="tk-ip-bars"><div><span>Affiliate 112</span><b>7</b><i style="--w:70%"></i></div><div><span>Affiliate 204</span><b>3</b><i style="--w:30%"></i></div><div><span>Unresolved</span><b>2</b><i style="--w:20%" class="unresolved"></i></div></div><p>10 chargebacks have linked affiliate attribution. Two remain unresolved. A source link does not establish causation.</p></div>
        <div class="tk-ip-window-foot"><span>Source records</span><span>Identity links</span><span>Unresolved cases</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="tk-ip-disclaimer">Example figures and interface are illustrative, not live customer data. Actual analysis depends on available integrations, permissions, and product capabilities.</p>
    <div class="tk-ip-section-head"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">FROM QUESTIONS TO EVIDENCE</span><h2>See the reasoning behind the result.</h2><p>Intelligence becomes more useful when you can investigate how a conclusion was reached—not just read a number.</p></div>
    <div class="tk-ip-investigation">
      <div class="tk-ip-investigation-left">
        <span class="tk-ip-step">01 / ASK</span><h3>Start with a business question.</h3><p>“Which affiliates are linked to the chargebacks in this period?”</p>
        <span class="tk-ip-step">02 / CONNECT</span><h3>Follow the relationships.</h3><p>Examine known click and affiliate identifiers, commercial transactions, and distinct dispute events.</p>
        <span class="tk-ip-step">03 / VERIFY</span><h3>See what's supported—and what isn't.</h3><p>Keep source evidence accessible and unresolved attribution visible. Never mistake a correlation for proven causation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tk-ip-evidence">
        <div class="tk-ip-evidence-header"><strong>Illustrative evidence review</strong><span>Sample records</span></div>
        <div class="tk-ip-evidence-row"><span>Affiliate 112</span><strong>7 linked disputes</strong><small>Attribution matched</small></div>
        <div class="tk-ip-evidence-row"><span>Affiliate 204</span><strong>3 linked disputes</strong><small>Attribution matched</small></div>
        <div class="tk-ip-evidence-row"><span>Unknown source</span><strong>2 disputes</strong><small class="tk-ip-unresolved">Needs investigation</small></div>
        <div class="tk-ip-evidence-note"><strong>Why this matters</strong><p>Every linked record should have a defensible source relationship. Missing evidence is a finding, too.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tk-ip-section-head tk-ip-cap-heading"><span class="tk-ip-kicker">BUILT FOR DEEPER QUESTIONS</span><h2>More than another dashboard.</h2></div>
    <div class="tk-ip-cap-grid">
      <article><span class="tk-ip-cap-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7"/><path d="m16 16 5 5M8 11h6M11 8v6"/></svg></span><h3>Investigate, don't just monitor.</h3><p>Go beyond a metric to explore the related events, sources, and discrepancies that deserve attention.</p></article>
      <article><span class="tk-ip-cap-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="5" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="12" r="2"/><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2"/><path d="M7 5h5a7 7 0 0 1 7 5M7 19h5a7 7 0 0 0 7-5"/></svg></span><h3>Connect acquisition to commerce.</h3><p>Explore attribution identity and commercial identity without collapsing different transactions into one event.</p></article>
      <article><span class="tk-ip-cap-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 3 3 7v5c0 5 3.5 8 9 9 5.5-1 9-4 9-9V7z"/><path d="m8 12 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Evidence you can inspect.</h3><p>Keep provider identifiers and supporting source records in view when evaluating a conclusion.</p></article>
      <article><span class="tk-ip-cap-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v6M12 17h.01"/></svg></span><h3>Make uncertainty visible.</h3><p>Surface unresolved or unmatched records rather than hiding gaps behind a deceptively complete answer.</p></article>
    </div>
    <div class="tk-ip-mcp">
      <div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">AN OPTIONAL EXTENSION</span><h2>Built into TraceKit.<br><em>Connected to your AI tools, too.</em></h2><p>Use TraceKit Intelligence inside the platform. When your workflow calls for an external assistant, compatible MCP clients can access supported, governed tools according to account permissions and setup.</p></div>
      <div class="tk-ip-mcp-clients"><span><img src="{{ 'ChatGPT_Logo_0.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><small>ChatGPT</small></span><span><img src="{{ 'Claude_AI_symbol.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><small>Claude</small></span><span><img src="{{ 'Cursor_Symbol_0.svg' | asset_url }}" alt="" loading="lazy"><small>Cursor</small></span><p>Compatibility and available operations vary. No external AI client is required to use built-in Intelligence.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tk-ip-cta"><div><span class="tk-ip-kicker">YOUR DATA HAS A STORY</span><h2>Stop guessing.<br>Start understanding.</h2><p>See how TraceKit could help your team investigate the evidence behind performance.</p></div><a class="btn" href="/pages/book-a-demo">Book a Personalized Demo →</a></div>
  </div>
</section>
